diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ea1a1a0..3c3184c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,30 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add v1 `Files.Upload`, which builds the multipart upload body from a file
+  name and a reader (like `CallLogs.AddRecording`) and can associate the file
+  with a deal, person, organization, product, activity, lead or project via
+  `WithFile...ID` options. The buffered body is replayable, so uploads are
+  retried on 429/502/503/504 according to the retry policy.
+- `WithFilesRequestOptions` now also applies to `Files.Upload`.
+
+### Changed
+
+- `Raw.Do` no longer closes caller-supplied seekable bodies (the standard
+  library transport previously closed them after the first attempt). Callers
+  keep responsibility for closing them, for example with `defer file.Close()`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Requests with seekable bodies, such as a file opened with `os.Open` and
+  streamed into v1 `Files.Add` or `Files.Update`, are now retried on
+  429/502/503/504. Previously `Raw.Do` only produced a replayable body for
+  `*bytes.Buffer`, `*bytes.Reader` and `*strings.Reader`, so uploads built
+  from any other reader failed immediately on a retryable response even with
+  `RetryPolicy.RetryAllMethods` enabled.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
